# AI model hubs and their first-party download/storage endpoints.
# Curated 2026-08-05 from live Civitai services and Hugging Face Hub docs.
# Keep this list ahead of generic CDN rules so large model downloads remain
# independently selectable without capturing whole cloud-storage providers.

# Civitai frontends, legacy aliases, images, and Backblaze-backed downloads.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,civitai.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,civitai.red
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,civitai.green
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,civitai.tech

# Hugging Face Hub, LFS, Xet, and first-party CDN endpoints. Hugging Face
# recommends these suffixes instead of pinning the current storage hostnames.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,huggingface.co
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hf.co
